Z||000007||Fierowrecker||11-06-2001||07:30 AM||||  <BLOCKQUOTE><font size="1" face="Verdana, Arial, Helvetica">quote:</font><HR>Originally posted by My7Fieros:<BR><B>I like Mustangs, I have a Mustang. So goddammit dont start yet another f-ing thread bad mouthing Mustangs. We went through this faze last month. <I>ENOUGH</I>..............<P></B><HR></BLOCKQUOTE><P>Stop being so defensive!<BR>You realize you bought a $hit car, and now you are trying to defend your choice...<BR>It's just like a $hit box Fiero, all those guys try to defend why they would own such a dog turd type of car...<P>Now, before you pop a hose clamp on your aorta, I AM JOKING!!!<P>There are always those people who will cut down another persons ride, no mater how fine a ride it may be...<P>Try owning and drag racing a 63 4 door Chevy II Nova...<BR>Had to blow the doors off a LOT of cars before I got any respect...<BR>But it was easy, as I had twice as many doors as they did, they had to work twice as hard...<P>Now, when anyone gives me trash talk, I ask if they would like to take a ride...<BR>I just go through the twisties, and sharp turns, about 40 to 50, Kyle knows the route by the park, and they shut up very fast...<P>------------------<BR>crash... The Fierowrecker<BR>          <IMG SRC="http://fiero.nl/uploads/crash_sig.jpg">          <IMG SRC="http://fiero.nl/forum/fullstaff.gif">  <p>[This message has been edited by Fierowrecker (edited 11-06-2001).]||||reg||1
